+  /**
+   * Asserts that two {@link JsonElement} values have no differences, i.e., {@link
+   * JsonDiff#diff(JsonElement, JsonElement)} returns an empty result. This validates that diff
+   * semantics are consistent with {@link JsonElement#equals(Object)}.
